    "description": "<p>This Charm expands its prerequisite with additional mutations whenever Wretched Ridden Nightmare is activated. The Abyssal must choose these extra mutations upon purchasing Saddled in Epic Monstrosity and cannot alter the selection with each activation. He may purchase this Charm a maximum number of times equal to his Ride rating to broaden the range of bonus mutations available, applying any one of these purchases whenever he activates Wretched Ridden Nightmare. Possible options for these mutations include: one abomination; one blight and one affliction; one blight and two poxes; three afflictions; or two afflictions and two poxes.</p>",
